    "cmyk": "CMYK values are conversions from sRGB, not proofs. Each is the closest colorimetric match (dE2000) within the standard's ink limit: North America, U.S. Web Coated (SWOP) v2; Europe, Coated FOGRA39 (ISO 12647-2:2004). Ask your printer to proof on their own press.",
